    4. Identify width-2 row bands and width-2 col bands (exclude any width-1 edge band)
    5. Pick one random width-2 row band and one random width-2 col band
    6. Pick marker color != bg, != lattice
    7. Replace the 2x2 intersection block with marker color
    8. Output = copy input, recolor all lattice pixels sharing marker's 2 rows or 2 cols to marker color
